# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，避免树莓派（Linux）拉下来出现 CRLF 导致
# python3 -m woodpulse 报 "bad interpreter" 之类的问题。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 上要双击运行的脚本保留 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
*.sog binary
*.db binary
*.pyc binary

# GitHub 语言统计：样例包与文档不要把 Python 淹掉
*.csv linguist-generated=true
*.json linguist-generated=true
samples/** linguist-vendored=true

# diff 里不展开的生成物
docs/shots/*.png -diff
samples/**/*.csv -diff
samples/**/*.json -diff
